    "system":  {
                   "description":  {
                                       "value":  "\u003cp\u003eGrew up in the chop-shop chrome trade.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkills:\u003c/strong\u003e choose 2 of: Cybertech, Repair, Streetwise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerk:\u003c/strong\u003e one Perk (suggested: crafting).\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5\u003eInciting Incident\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoll or choose a d6 Inciting Incident - the event that pushed you into the run economy:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e1 - A run went wrong: you were the one who got out, or the one who got blamed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e2 - A corp betrayal: the employer you trusted sold you out or cut you loose.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e3 - A debt came due: a favor, a loan, or a mistake put you on the hook.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e4 - The Veil touched you: a brush with the Dark One\u0027s agents, a haunting, a mark.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e5 - The body changed: a mutation surfaced, chrome rejected, or a decay set in.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e6 - Someone was taken: a person you loved vanished, was killed, or was disappeared.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIf your rolled incident predates this Career, treat it as the break that ended your old life and started the one this Career describes.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
